ance; falling behind the AI transition would erode the company's core differentiation, which is an AI-first operating model.","risk":"Pace of AI-led change demanding continuous reinvestment"},{"note":"Intensifying competition for AI-capable talent affects both delivery capacity and cost structure in a business where employee costs are the dominant input.","risk":"Competition for skilled AI and technology talent, and a shifting hiring pyramid"},{"note":"Heightened cyber security and data-protection risks are flagged as a threat, and Data Privacy and Security is identified in the BRSR as a material risk driven by rising cyberthreats and more stringent data protection laws; mitigation is through regular security audits, encryption, staff training and data-protection protocols.","risk":"Cyber security and data-protection exposure"},{"note":"Management flags margin pressure during periods of high investment, consistent with its position that FY26 profitability sat above steady-state levels and should not be treated as a new baseline.","risk":"Margin pressure from escalating operating and talent costs"},{"note":"Uncertainty is flagged as affecting client spending trajectories, with the Company's risk framework overseen by the Risk Management Committee which frames, implements and monitors the risk management plan and reviews its effectiveness.","risk":"Global macroeconomic and geopolitical uncertainty"},{"note":"The pace of technology evolution necessitates continuous upskilling of the workforce; the Company reports 44,970 man-hours of learning during FY26 and collaboration with the IIMs as its mitigation.","risk":"Rapid technology evolution requiring continuous upskilling"}],"rpt":{},"rpt_date":"","s":"INFOBEAN","sector":"Information Technology","sk":{"as_of":"2026-06-17","cagrs":[{"cagr":"3.7%","period":"CY2024-CY2029P","segment":"Global M&E market"},{"cagr":"4.5%","period":"CY2024-CY2029P","segment":"Broadcasting & streaming (incl. advertising)"},{"cagr":"~10%","period